        <mxCell id="M9Dyo_UtoVc3m4d_t0XK-34" parent="M9Dyo_UtoVc3m4d_t0XK-32" style="text;align=center;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;sketch=1;curveFitting=1;jiggle=2;sketchStyle=comic;shadow=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Leto;fontSize=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF54;gradientColor=#DDDDDD54;strokeColor=#AAAAAA88;fillWeight=-1;fontColor=#444444;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=8;spacing=4;strokeWidth=3;spacingRight=18;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;container=0;recursiveResize=0;expand=0;editable=1;movable=1;resizable=1;rotatable=1;deletable=1;locked=0;connectable=1;collapsible=0;glass=0;html=1;opacity=70;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;padding: 4px; margin: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Architects Daughter&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Legend&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);&quot;&gt;A brief guide to the items seen in this chart&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;COPPERPLATE&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 28px; line-height: 100%;&quot;&gt;Governance&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; margin-right: 0px; padding-right: 100px; margin-left: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;COPPERPLATE&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Main Hotl Loop&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; margin-right: 50px; padding-right: 0px; margin-left: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);&quot;&gt;The orange dashed hexagons sit outside the loop: human observation, not approval. The turquoise dashed arrows are the loop itself, which runs without them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; margin-right: 100px; padding-left: 4px; padding-top: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;COPPERPLATE&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Humans on the loop&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; margin-right: 50px; padding-left: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Asynchronous&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt; human oversight.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(68, 68, 68), rgb(179, 179, 179)); font-weight: normal; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Humans monitor, get alerts, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(68, 68, 68), rgb(179, 179, 179)); background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;intervene if needed, but do &lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(68, 68, 68), rgb(179, 179, 179)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;not&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(68, 68, 68), rgb(179, 179, 179)); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;block the loop.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; margin-right: 100px; padding-left: 4px; padding-top: 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;COPPERPLATE&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Circuit Breakers&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; margin-right: 100px; padding-left: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);&quot;&gt;Automated tripwires: halt or roll back the loop, no human needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; margin-right: 0px; padding-left: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;text-align: center; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; margin-right: 100px; padding-left: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(68, 68, 68);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;COPPERPLATE&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 28px; line-height: 100%;&quot;&gt;Non-blocking Nodes&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);&quot;&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Non-blocking nodes in loop:&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;font-weight: 400; padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 4px; margin-right: 100px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 110%;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;Model Training Service&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;Model Prediction Service&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;Data Service&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;Data Pipeline&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;Product Interface&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;Automated Data Validation&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left; font-weight: 400; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(68, 68, 68), rgb(179, 179, 179));&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(68, 68, 68), rgb(179, 179, 179)); margin-right: 0px; padding-left: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;text-align: center; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(68, 68, 68), rgb(179, 179, 179)); margin-right: 100px; padding-left: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 28px; font-family: COPPERPLATE; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(68, 68, 68), rgb(179, 179, 179));&quot;&gt;AI Engineer Node&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;padding-left: 15px; margin-top: 4px; margin-right: 50px; margin-bottom: 4px; line-height: 110%;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Gathers initial data for training&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Tunes wrangling for optimal model signal&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Build initial model / parameters for Model Training Service&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Can intervene to change model topology, data wrangling, etc.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="1084" width="575" x="1950" y="12" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="M9Dyo_UtoVc3m4d_t0XK-37" parent="M9Dyo_UtoVc3m4d_t0XK-32" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;sketch=1;curveFitting=1;jiggle=2;sketchStyle=comic;shadow=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF54;gradientColor=#DDDDDD54;strokeColor=#AAAAAA88;strokeWidth=3;fontFamily=Leto;fontSize=24;fontColor=#444444;align=left;verticalAlign=top;arcSize=8;spacing=2;html=1;glass=0;opacity=70;fillWeight=-1;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;fontStyle=1;resizable=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center; padding-top: 4px; padding-bottom: 0px; line-height: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;line-height: 100%;&quot;&gt;💡&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;line-height: 100%;&quot; face=&quot;Architects Daughter&quot;&gt;Closing The Loop&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;line-height: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;HITL:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica; text-align: center;&quot;&gt; Humans gate the loop&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;(approval before proceeding)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;HOTL:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica; text-align: center;&quot;&gt; Humans observe the loop&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;(monitor, alert, intervene if needed).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;The human is now a watchdog&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;instead of a gatekeeper.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;HITL&lt;/b&gt; fails by starvation. &lt;b&gt;HOTL&lt;/b&gt; fails by poisoning: fast, quiet, and at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="300" width="575" x="1950" y="1110" as="geometry" />
